poet and essayist Anne Carson can feel slightly daunting. Here are some keys to understanding her universe.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>EU envoy in Beijing for talks to calm trade tensions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6567d20dc0fc99f306f15d72014a465843bfac17b0e9bf4e6e0f618a56b411e2</id><updated>2026-10-08T15:44:27Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T14:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-envoy-in-beijing-for-talks-to-calm-trade-tensions/a-79598713--6570dc66b587.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-envoy-in-beijing-for-talks-to-calm-trade-tensions/a-79598713?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The EU trade envoy said he hoped to make progress in tackling the bloc's "unsustainable" trade imbalance with China. Beijing called for trade disputes to be resolved through equal dialogue.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India faces water and power stress after weak monsoon</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b714c532028bce05383771a490e359fc022999569cd8f8b90b8400e042e397eb</id><updated>2026-10-08T15:44:30Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T14:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-faces-water-and-power-stress-after-weak-monsoon/a-79599540--95c0beffc2a3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-faces-water-and-power-stress-after-weak-monsoon/a-79599540?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A weak monsoon is hitting farmers, water supplies and India's power system, while raising wider questions about increasingly erratic rainfall and its economic costs.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>World Cup 2034: Does Saudi Arabia shelving Neom Stadium spell trouble?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d92f0b8d108c2a57c20d21f01300b1a8882b031fb8deed03287d55c8da5e04d2</id><updated>2026-10-08T15:44:33Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T14:24:00Z</published>